#X obj 800 400 r wil-state;
#X obj 800 430 print state;
#X text 20 520 What Is Left receiver \, UDP 9000. Every OSC address is re-sent as [s wil-<name>] \, so grab anything with [r wil-killed] \, [r wil-shares] etc. in your own patch. killed = freq section \, fled/returned/uprooted/resettled/disappeared = freq \, shares = home killed dis inside fled back ks ss sf \, rates = kill flee return uproot disappear \, voice = index freq home k d s f b \, country = iso name start last.;
